WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.267
Okay,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.267
a number series!

00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:10.933
Seven,

00:00:10.933 --> 00:00:11.633
fourteen,

00:00:11.633 --> 00:00:12.300
twenty-one,

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:12.967
twenty-eight,

00:00:12.967 --> 00:00:14.300
and then...

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.300
what comes next?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:16.967
A.

00:00:16.967 --> 00:00:17.633
Thirty-three,

00:00:17.633 --> 00:00:18.333
B.

00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.000
Forty-two,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:19.667
C.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:20.333
Thirty-six,

00:00:20.333 --> 00:00:21.667
or D.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.333
Thirty-five?

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:23.667
Five seconds!

00:00:29.467 --> 00:00:30.667
TIME'S UP!

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.133
The answer is...

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:33.733
D,

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:34.333
thirty-five!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.967
Each number goes up by seven:

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:38.567
seven,

00:00:38.567 --> 00:00:39.167
fourteen,

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:39.767
twenty-one,

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:40.367
twenty-eight,

00:00:40.367 --> 00:00:43.967
so twenty-eight plus seven is thirty-five.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.967
Check this out,

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:48.800
a word analogy!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.233
Caterpillar is to butterfly,

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:53.667
as tadpole is to...

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:54.267
what?

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:54.867
A.

00:00:54.867 --> 00:00:55.500
Fish,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:56.100
B.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:56.700
Frog,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.333
C.

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:57.933
Pond,

00:00:57.933 --> 00:00:59.133
or D.

00:00:59.133 --> 00:00:59.767
Egg?

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:00.967
Five seconds!

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:07.967
TIME'S UP!

00:01:08.633 --> 00:01:09.100
It's...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:09.567
B,

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:10.033
frog!

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.867
A caterpillar grows into a butterfly,

00:01:12.867 --> 00:01:15.667
so a tadpole grows into a

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:16.133
frog.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:18.967
It is what each one becomes.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.533
Check this out,

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:23.467
fill in the blank!

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:26.333
The hikers felt so blank after

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:29.233
climbing all day that they stopped

00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:31.633
to rest beside the trail.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:32.100
A.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:32.567
Curious,

00:01:32.567 --> 00:01:33.067
B.

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:33.533
Early,

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:34.033
C.

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:34.500
Exhausted,

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:35.467
or D.

00:01:35.467 --> 00:01:35.933
Gentle?

00:01:35.933 --> 00:01:36.900
Five seconds!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.900
TIME'S UP!

00:01:44.567 --> 00:01:45.100
It's...

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:45.600
C,

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.133
exhausted!

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:49.233
Climbing all day makes you very

00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:49.733
tired.

00:01:49.733 --> 00:01:53.367
Exhausted means worn out and needing rest.

00:01:54.533 --> 00:01:54.933
So,

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:56.967
are you smart or fart?

00:01:56.967 --> 00:01:59.400
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.600
find your rank!

00:02:01.767 --> 00:02:02.100
So,

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.500
how did you do?

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.867
Comment your score below,

00:02:04.867 --> 00:02:06.233
and follow for more!
